{"id": "EUVD-2026-97610", "enisaUuid": "395893a6-d801-3bfa-86fd-cc19b3557d23", "description": "Craft CMS 4.0.0 before 4.18.7 and 5.0.0 before 5.10.14 passes the raw 'updates' request parameter in AppController::actionCacheUpdates to UpdatesModel without Component::cleanseConfig(), allowing behavior and event-handler injection. Authenticated control panel users with the performUpdates permission or Updates-utility access can supply 'as' or 'on' keys, such as an AttributeTypecastBehavior gadget, to execute arbitrary code.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:47:12", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-5m2g-hhqr-84pc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/craft-cms-4.0.0-before-4.18.7-and-5.0.0-before-5.10.14-rce-via-actioncacheupdates-behavior-injection"], "aliases": ["GHSA-r8mr-vm79-xxh4", "CVE-2026-109308"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "930a95ff-b1da-345a-844f-7429f45b1c28", "product": {"name": "CMS", "vendor": {"name": "statamic"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 <5.10.14"}, {"id": "94e1a23f-b1c5-32be-93f9-309928bf1579", "product": {"name": "CMS", "vendor": {"name": "statamic"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <4.18.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d37720f2-444f-31e0-b6f5-6432c2adae45", "vendor": {"name": "craftcms"}}], "isExploited": false}